      "type": "ENHANCEMENT",
      "description": "Flow Capture now intercepts links that would open in new tabs during recording sessions. When clicking a link that would normally open in a new tab (via target=\"_blank\" or cmd/ctrl+click), users are presented with a dialog offering two options: open in a new tab (exiting the recording context) or open in the current tab (continuing the recording). This prevents accidental loss of recording context when navigating between pages.",
